  <h2 style="margin-top:10mm;">From Snapshot to Session</h2>

  <p class="lede">The snapshot is the instrument. The session is where the operation runs at full depth: your situation, structured in real time, interactively, with the variables that proved relevant carried forward and the rest set aside.</p>

  <p>Seipsum users report: reduced cognitive blockage, clearer separation between relevant and irrelevant information, more stable decisions, and a clear direction of action.</p>

  <p>Bring your completed snapshot. It is a better starting point than a blank page.</p>

